# Add response caching

This PR puts a cache in front of the database.

@animate
Before: every request hits the database, 240ms p95, database is the bottleneck
After: repeat requests served from cache, 12ms p95, database load down 80%
@end

The new read path:

@animate
api: API
cache: Cache
db: Database

api sends LOOKUP to cache
cache replies HIT to api
@end
